From: Senemos contributors
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: stage both O82 links before command broadcast

Adapt exact Uke OEM dual staging, slave/master triggers and completion checks
using existing native packet, clock and buffer helpers. Keep reads and other
panels on their existing paths. Timeout disables and resets both controllers;
a failed idle check requires reboot without unbind, reprobe or KMS teardown.
This is a bounded physical trial, not production recovery qualification.

Reference: MiCode display 44275c404a677d9d9e5230fedd1af2ef02fc7b9a,
msm/dsi/dsi_display.c, dsi_ctrl.c and dsi_ctrl_hw_cmn.c, GPL-2.0-only,
Linux Foundation and Qualcomm. No panel data, timing or voltage change.

